01 Knapsack
    In 01 Knapsack, every element is either included in the sack or or skipped but is processed in single operation. That means that
    every element is either included in the sack once or skipped.

Unbounded Knapsack
    In unbounded knapsack, any element can have multiple occurrence. If the element is skipped then it is processed, but if the element
    is included it can be included multiple times.